          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਸ਼ਤਰੰਜ (shatranj) is a loan, usually traced to Persian shatranj, \"chess\", which goes back to Sanskrit caturaṅga, \"four-limbed\"."
